Our answer for the above points are as under:
Point No.1: In the negative;
Point No.2: as per final order.

For the aforesaid reasons and discussions, we proceed to pass the following:
ORDER 1. MFA No.101026 of 2018 preferred by the Insurance Company is dismissed;
2. MFA No.102592 of 2018 preferred by the claimant is allowed in part;
3. Judgment and order dated 13th November, 2017 passed in ECA No.25 of 2016 by the I Additional Senior Civil Judge and Commissioner under Employees'
Compensation Act, Belagavi is modified by enhancing the compensation to Rs.11,60,015/-
as against 10,94,942/-, which shall carry interest at the rate of 12% per annum payable after thirty days from the date of accident till deposit;
